    "body": "**What?**\r\n- on home page before you sign in https://notifier.cdssandbox.xyz/\r\n- There is a banner that says 'Notify uses cookies to make the site simpler. Find out more about cookies'\r\n- I want it cut\r\n\r\n**Why?**\r\n- EU law says you have to tell people what you use cookies for and I don't want to care about that. People can go look it up on the cookies page here https://notifier.cdssandbox.xyz/cookies",
